# Yellow Gold Marquise Engagement Ring ({{year}}): 4 Color Grades That Save $800

![Three loose marquise cut diamonds held in jeweller tweezers against a soft grey backdrop as the DiamondCritics featured image for the {{year}} yellow gold marquise engagement ring guide titled 4 color grades that save eight hundred dollars](/images/yellow-gold-marquise-engagement-ring.jpg "Yellow Gold Marquise Engagement Ring 4 Color Grades That Save Eight Hundred Dollars")

## TL;DR — Yellow Gold Marquise Engagement Ring in One Scroll

**A yellow gold marquise engagement ring pairs the warm metal with a marquise-cut diamond — and the metal choice directly changes the colour grade you need on the stone.** White metals (platinum, white gold) force you toward G or higher colour because any yellow tint in the stone contrasts with the cool white metal. Yellow gold does the opposite: the warm metal masks warm colour in the stone. You can drop 2–3 colour grades on a yellow gold marquise and save $500–$1,200 without any visible difference to the eye.

**The 4 colour grades that save $800 on a yellow gold marquise (all 4 covered in full below):**

- **Grade 1 — H colour.** The sweet spot. Zero visible warmth. $400–$500 saved vs F. Our default pick for yellow gold.
- **Grade 2 — I colour.** 1 grade warmer. Still eye-clean in yellow metal. $600–$700 saved vs F. Our high-value pick.
- **Grade 3 — J colour.** Our max-savings pick. Barely detectable warmth. $800+ saved vs F. Works for buyers prioritising stone size over colour grade.
- **Grade 4 — K colour.** Only in yellow gold. Visible warmth even in warm metal. $1,200+ saved. Specific use case for vintage-aesthetic buyers who want the warm-stone antique look.

→ Entry pick: **[Ten Prong Solitaire in 14k Yellow Gold at $860](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-311236?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** — market floor, ten-prong max tip protection.
→ Classic pick: **[Petite Solitaire in 14k Yellow Gold at $1,000](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-195639?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** — timeless slim-band classic.
→ Cathedral pick: **[Tapered Cathedral Solitaire in 14k Yellow Gold at $1,240](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/tapered-cathedral-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-203288?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** — raised cathedral in warm metal.
→ Three-stone pick: **[Marquise Three Stone in 14k Yellow Gold at $1,970 (JA)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/marquise-cut-diamond-three-stone-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-315107?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** — natural marquise flankers + yellow gold.

**Priority:** stop at H colour minimum for white metal settings — but drop to I or J if you pick yellow gold. The savings are real ($800+ on a 1ct stone) with zero visible compromise. See the full [marquise cut diamond guide](/marquise-cut-diamond) for shape fundamentals.

## Expert Summary

Yellow gold marquise engagement ring pricing in current certified market inventory starts at **$860** for the Ten Prong Solitaire in 14k Yellow Gold and runs to **$4,750** for the Escalating Baguette Side Stone in 14k Yellow Gold. 49 yellow gold settings sit between those tiers across every style — solitaire, halo, three-stone, pavé, bezel, cathedral, vintage, east-west. Add a 1ct marquise H-color centre and the complete ring sits at $1,460 for lab, $3,860+ for natural.

I'm Farzana Hasan, a [GIA](https://www.gia.edu/)-certified diamond expert. The yellow gold + marquise colour-saving strategy is one of the fastest spend-to-dollar-saved plays in the whole engagement ring category. In 15+ years grading diamonds, I have shown clients the H vs F comparison in yellow gold on hundreds of occasions. Zero of them could spot the difference by eye. The $500 saved per colour grade compounds — buyers who pick J in yellow gold often save enough to upgrade the setting style or add a wedding band. Full credentials at **[Diamond Critics](https://diamondcritics.com/about-farzana/)**. Our pillar **[marquise cut diamond guide](/marquise-cut-diamond)** covers every related topic.

This guide covers the 4 colour grades that save $800 in yellow gold, the Warm-Metal Color Masking Effect, the Marquise Belly Color Pool concept, the 4-Grade Yellow Gold Rule, 1ct to 2.5ct centre pairing math, and the full yellow gold marquise inventory from $860 to $4,750 across all setting styles. All prices verified against live certified inventory. Pricing presented as independent market research.

