1e63&chan=blog-informational">$3,030</a></td><td>Bezel baguette three-stone.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Vintage Inspired Halo (Zac Posen)</strong></td><td>Designer Vintage Halo</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/zac-zac-posen-vintage-inspired-halo-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-203824?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$3,135</a></td><td>Zac Posen vintage halo.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>The Ritz Round Halo (3/8 ct.)</strong></td><td>Round Halo (yellow metal)</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/the-ritz-round-halo-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-3-8-ct-tw-item-203831?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$3,155</a></td><td>The Ritz series. Request marquise halo at order.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Square Halo (Zac Posen)</strong></td><td>Geometric Halo</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/zac-zac-posen-square-halo-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-item-203811?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$3,160</a></td><td>Square halo variant. Geometric contrast.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pear Shape Side Stone Diamond Halo (JA)</strong></td><td>Halo + Side Stones</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/pear-shape-side-stone-diamond-halo-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-310843?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$3,570</a></td><td>Pear side stones + halo wrap.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Floral Side Stone (JA)</strong></td><td>Vintage Floral Side-Stone</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/floral-side-stone-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-304657?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$3,895</a></td><td>Floral 